From: Qiongsi Wu <qiongsiwu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 May 2025 11:11:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "[clang][Dependency Scanning] Report What a Module
 Exports during Scanning (#137421)" (#140820)

This reverts commit ea1bfbf3f6399b7d2d840722f0e87542d00f6a35.

The commit did not solve the fundamental issue we need to handle and is
no longer necessary.

rdar://144794793
